    {"SteamVR: an adaptive timing reserve near full refresh. Framework uses 3 deliveries instead of 2; Director uses 4 instead of 3. Independent of Fast mode. Other private runtimes change capacity only. Changes apply after queued frames complete.","SteamVR：接近满刷新率时自适应预留调度余量。框架的提交容量从 2 增至 3，调度器从 3 增至 4。与快速模式独立。其他专用运行时仅增加容量，排队帧处理完后生效。"},
